resources.string:
The built-in browser is used by default when browsing web pages. If you need to change it, please go to "More Settings-Sun Browser Lite" from the homepage;
        There is no widget style that allows you to switch search engines. You can click on the logo on the left side of the widget to switch.
        \nSpecial reminder: the magic widget only provides search engine aggregation and quick link functions. The search content is provided by the corresponding engine, so please be careful in your discernment.
